    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that setting (and clearing) the modify / access / create timestamps on an {@link X5455_ExtendedTimestamp} keeps the corresponding \"present\" flag bits in sync. <p>The flags byte packs three independent bits:</p> <ul> <li>bit 0 (value 1) - modify time present</li> <li>bit 1 (value 2) - access time present</li> <li>bit 2 (value 4) - create time present</li> </ul> <p>Each {@code setXxxJavaTime(Date)} call must turn the matching bit on, and each {@code setXxxJavaTime(null)} call must turn it back off, leaving the other bits untouched.</p>"
   },
